                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Classification of form of payment.</hi></head>
                <p>Gold, silver, copper, bank-notes; in all two hundred and twenty thousand pesetas.
                    Registered the 17th day of April, 1875, in which the payment was effected.</p>
                <p>The central accountant,</p>
                <closer><signed>FERNANDO FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
